        "name": "Stand Behind Me",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Braum leaps to a target allied champion or minion. On arrival, Braum and the ally gain Armor and Magic Resist for a few seconds.",
        "bodyHtml": "Braum leaps to an allied champion or minion. On arrival, Braum grants the target <span class=\"text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400\">(20/25/30/35/40 + ([[si:scalearmor]]12% bonus Armor)) Armor</span> and <span>(20/25/30/35/40 + ([[si:scalemr]]12% bonus Magic Resist)) Magic Resist</span> for 3 seconds. Braum grants himself <span class=\"text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400\">(20/25/30/35/40 + ([[si:scalearmor]]36% bonus Armor)) Armor</span> and <span>(20/25/30/35/40 + ([[si:scalemr]]36% bonus Magic Resist)) Magic Resist</span> for the same duration.",
