        "name": "Glacial Fissure",
        "maxRank": 3,
        "summary": "Braum slams the ground, knocking up enemies nearby and in a line in front of him. A fissure is left along the line that slows enemies.",
        "bodyHtml": "Braum slams the ground sending forth a fissure that <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knocks Up</span> enemies in its path and nearby Braum, and deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(150/250/350 + ([[si:scaleap]]60% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>. The first target hit is <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knocked Up</span> for between 0.6 and 1/1.5/2 seconds, increasing with distance from Braum. All others hit are <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knocked Up</span> for 0.6 seconds.<br /><br />The fissure also creates a zone for 4 seconds, that <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slows</span> by 40/50/60%.<br />",
